Identification and Potency Analysis of PCV3 Monoclonal Antibody {#S3.SS2}
---------------------------------------------------------------

The figure reveals the successful building of recombinant plasmid pET32a-PCV1 Cap, pET32a-PCV2 Cap, pET32a-PCV3 Cap ([Figure 3A](#F3){ref-type="fig"}). Meantime, recombinant PCV1, PCV2, and PCV3 Cap proteins exhibited successful expression using prokaryotic expression system; then, they were purified ([Figure 3B](#F3){ref-type="fig"}).

