Rescued PCV3 Virus Pathogenicity Analysis {#S3.SS6}
-----------------------------------------

During the experiment, no clinical variations were observed in the control group of mice. On the third day after infection, the infected group of mice was slightly depressed. Individual mice were reluctant to move, and no other symptoms occurred apparently. The tissues and organs of the control group and the experimental group were basically normal, and no significant variations were observed ([Figure 7A](#F7){ref-type="fig"}).

